# ✅ Experiment: Finding & Exploiting XSS Vulnerabilities (DVWA)

## 🎯 Aim:

To identify and exploit Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerabilities using DVWA in Kali Linux.

---

# 🔹 Requirements

✔ Kali Linux
✔ DVWA
✔ Apache & MySQL running
✔ Firefox

---

# 🔥 PART 1: Start DVWA

---

## ✅ Step 1: Start Services

Open Terminal:

```bash
sudo service apache2 start
sudo service mysql start
```

Open browser:

```
http://localhost/dvwa
```

Login:

```
Username: admin
Password: password
```

---

## ✅ Step 2: Set Security Level

Go to:

```
DVWA Security
```

Set:

```
Security Level = Low
```

Click Submit.

---

