# 🔥 Viva Questions (Prepare These)

### ❓ What is XSS?

Cross-Site Scripting allows attackers to inject malicious JavaScript into web pages.

### ❓ Difference between Reflected and Stored XSS?

Reflected → Executes immediately, not stored
Stored → Saved in database, executes every time page loads

### ❓ What is DOM XSS?

Client-side XSS caused by modifying DOM via URL.

### ❓ How to Prevent XSS?

✔ Input validation
✔ Output encoding
✔ Content Security Policy
✔ HttpOnly cookies

